  "limitations": [
    "One pinned model family (deepseek-v4.1-flash) built every candidate and also served as the judge. No independent human reviewers took part.",
    "The panel used three LLM passes per pair. LLM passes are repeated measurements, not independent reviewers, and do not satisfy the confirmatory human-review minimum.",
    "A swapped-label control found a strong candidate-position effect in 6 of 9 pairs.",
    "Only default-state desktop and mobile screenshots were captured for judging; interaction states were reviewed from source and checks, not rendered.",
    "Condition order was randomized and recorded, but runs were executed concurrently in waves rather than sequentially.",
    "The ~20-minute target was not enforced; recorded durations ranged from about 15 to 49 minutes.",
    "Screenshots were captured through a local static HTTP server for both conditions to avoid file:// CORS differences.",
    "All data in the prototypes is synthetic. Automated axe checks cover only the rules they ran and are not proof of WCAG conformance.",
    "No statistical significance test was performed. The scorer reports descriptive arithmetic only."
  ]
}
